Nerds!
For too long you have struggled with tools like Obsidian and org-mode! Property blocks could never fit your knowledge in! We all wanted memex, a true database, and all we were offered was zettelkasten, or a private schema on SQL. We wanted to grow power with every entry, but all we got were growing costs. No more! Store thousands of entries, read them in plain text, and run powerful queries. Share through git or p2p.
